---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About ScholarAB | Free Alberta Scholarship Directory"
  description="ScholarAB is a free scholarship directory built by Ilia Ivanov, a Medicine Hat high school student. No ads, no login, no data sold."
  ogTitle="About ScholarAB | Free Alberta Scholarship Directory"
  ogDescription="ScholarAB is a free scholarship directory built by Ilia Ivanov, a Medicine Hat high school student. No ads, no login, no data sold."
  ogUrl="https://www.scholarab.ca/about"
  currentPath="/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl">

    <div class="mb-8 pt-2">
      <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border-card);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-secondary);">About</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-primary font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-6" style="font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,48px);">
      Built by a student,<br><span class="text-brand">for students.</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="space-y-4 mb-10" style="font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,16px);line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:-0.005em;">
      <p>
        Last year I spent three weekends trying to find scholarships. Every list was out of date. Every aggregator wanted my email before it'd show me anything useful. Most required signup, and half the links were broken.
      </p>
      <p>
        So I built what I wished existed. ScholarAB is a directory — not a platform. There's no login, no ad tracking, no newsletter. Just Canadian scholarships and research programs, kept current by hand.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Match quiz is in beta — it uses your grade, city, and interests to rank opportunities you're likely to qualify for. It's not magic; it's a filter. It'll get better as more students try it.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you find something broken or missing, email me. I read every one.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Principles glass card -->
    <div class="card p-5 mb-5">
      <p style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-faint);margin-bottom:14px;">How this works</p>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex gap-3 items-center">
          <span style="font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;">🚫</span>
          <p class="text-sm text-secondary">No ads or sponsored listings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3 items-center">
          <span style="font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;">🔒</span>
          <p class="text-sm text-secondary">No data collected. Bookmarks stay on your device.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3 items-center">
          <span style="font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;">👤</span>
          <p class="text-sm text-secondary">No account required. Ever.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Open source + contact -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-8">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/scholarab/scholarab"
        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-secondary hover:text-primary"
        style="background:var(--bg-subtle);border:0.5px solid var(--border-card);"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
      <!--email_off--><a
        href="mailto:contact.scholarab@gmail.com"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-secondary hover:text-primary"
        style="background:var(--bg-subtle);border:0.5px solid var(--border-card);"
      >
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
        contact.scholarab@gmail.com
      </a><!--/email_off-->
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-faint">
      Created by <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/iliaivanov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-secondary hover:text-primary transition-colors font-medium">Ilia Ivanov</a>, a <a href="https://mhhs.mhpsd.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">Medicine Hat High School</a> student.
    </p>

  </div>
</Layout>
